  "body": "Use the \"debug\" package https://www.npmjs.com/package/debug for logging.\r\n\r\nDebugging can be enabled by setting the DEBUG environment variable, for example\r\n\r\n  DEBUG=streams:* npm test\r\n\r\nThis change converts existed commented-out log statements in\r\ntransform-streams.js to use the debug package. No new logging statements are\r\nincluded in this change.\r\n\r\nIt is anticipated that new logging statements will be added as and when a need\r\nfor them is found.\r\n\r\nCloses #499.",
